    "latest_report": {
      "id": "16182f44-1856-4064-8cec-1fb278b0f252",
      "name": "Snow Report 2026-08-24 07:25:29",
      "date": "2026-08-24 07:25:29",
      "location": {
        "uuid": "d23b232c-529b-4408-9a10-602ab79c548a",
        "name": "Primary"
      },
      "report": "<p><strong>August 24 - September 2</strong></p><p><em><strong>Redline will be closed Thursday and Friday this week for </strong></em><a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/events-activities/events/events-calendar/redline-rally/\"><em><strong>Redline Rally</strong></em></a><em><strong> prep. It will reopen Saturday <u>after</u> the event.&nbsp;</strong></em></p><p>The <a href=\"https://forecast.weather.gov/MapClick.php?lon=-121.67019367218019&amp;lat=43.97341445519288#.YYloWmDMI2x\"><strong>forecast </strong></a>this week calls for partly cloudy skies and cooler temps, with highs hovering between 60-70 degrees during operating hours. Overnight lows are expected to dip into the 30's. Check the <a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/the-mountain/lift-trail-report/\"><strong>Lift &amp; Trail Status page</strong></a> for the full list of available Bike Park and hiking trails.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Events</strong></p><p>This week is once again packed with events, starting with <a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/events-activities/events/events-calendar/lady-laps-4/\"><strong>Lady Laps Tech Talk at Trailhead Lodge</strong></a> on Tuesday. This session is at capacity, but there's still time to join us for the final Lady Laps meet up on September 26 - registration coming soon. On Wednesday, Trailhead Lodge will host free <a href=\"https://www.trailheadlodgebend.com/events-activities/events/lawn-yoga3/\"><strong>Yoga on the Lawn</strong></a> - registration is still open. Up on the mountain, we'll have <a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/events-activities/events/events-calendar/yoga-in-the-wild-6/\"><strong>Yoga in the Wild</strong></a> on Thursday, followed by Mt. Bachelor's most anticipated Bike Park competition on Saturday, <a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/events-activities/events/events-calendar/redline-rally/\"><strong>Redline Rally</strong></a><strong>.</strong> While you must have an invite to ride in the rally, the event is open and free to spectators. Visit the <a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/events-activities/events/events-calendar/\"><strong>Events Page&nbsp;</strong></a>to learn more about upcoming happenings.</p><p><strong>Please Note:</strong></p><ul><li><em>Mt. Bachelor allows&nbsp;</em><a href=\"https://transitbikes.com/blog/class-1-ebike-explained/\"><strong>Class-1 pedal-assist e-mountain bikes</strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong>o<em>n its downhill Bike Park trails. Class 2 and 3 e-bikes are prohibited. Mt. Bachelor continues to welcome the use of adaptive e-bikes.</em></li><li><em>Uphill riding is prohibited on all Mt. Bachelor trails and service roads, and all users must have a valid&nbsp;</em><a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/tickets-passes/summer-tickets-passes/#daily\"><em><strong>lift ticket or pass</strong></em></a><em> to enjoy the Bike Park.\u202f</em></li><li><em>Smoking and vaping are not permitted anywhere at Mt. Bachelor, except inside personal vehicles.</em></li></ul><p><a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/events-activities/summer-activities/\"><em><strong>Summer activities</strong></em></a><em><strong> </strong>at Mt. Bachelor include Bike Park, a zipline ZipTour, Sunset Dinners, scenic chairlift rides, camping, hiking, dining, and disc golf. Mt. Bachelor also has a licensed </em><a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/amenities-groups/childcare/\"><em><strong>Childcare Center</strong></em></a><em><strong> </strong>and </em><a href=\"https://www.mtbachelor.com/lessons-rentals/kids-camps/\"><em><strong>Kids Bike Camps</strong></em></a><em>. Plus, Sun Country Tours is in full swing, offering a variety of half and full-day </em><a href=\"https://www.suncountrytours.com/whitewater-rafting/choose-your-trip/compare/\"><em><strong>whitewater rafting adventures</strong></em></a><em><strong> </strong>and </em><a href=\"https://www.suncountrytours.com/tubing-sup/river-tube/\"><em><strong>river tube rentals</strong></em></a><em><strong> </strong>including transportation to and from the water via electric golf cart shuttles.</em></p>",
